WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.024 --> 01:43.453
=Episode 15=
(We'll Meet as We Expected)

01:53.921 --> 01:56.576
(Send Waitlist Admission File)

02:27.192 --> 02:27.913
It's a confession.

02:28.152 --> 02:29.153
Look.

02:29.153 --> 02:30.793
A guy is confessing downstairs.

02:31.192 --> 02:32.433
He's so brave.

02:37.072 --> 02:38.233
Come on. I can't believe

02:38.592 --> 02:39.793
he will confess with flowers

02:39.793 --> 02:40.913
and a loudspeaker.

02:41.032 --> 02:42.032
So corny.

02:42.472 --> 02:42.992
What?

02:43.072 --> 02:43.833
Xu Zhi.

02:43.953 --> 02:44.472
Look.

02:44.833 --> 02:46.793
A guy is confessing, holding flowers.

02:46.873 --> 02:48.072
It's so outdated.

02:48.833 --> 02:51.152
What's worse, it's a moral abduction.

02:51.632 --> 02:53.433
It's fine
if the boy and girl like each other.

02:53.433 --> 02:54.793
If the girl doesn't like the boy,

02:55.112 --> 02:56.152
she'll be put on the spot.

02:56.152 --> 02:57.192
It's so awkward.

02:57.713 --> 02:59.233
If I were the girl,

03:00.433 --> 03:02.592
I'd be so embarrassed.

03:02.672 --> 03:03.672
I can't stand it.

03:05.472 --> 03:08.793
Xu Zhi, the Architecture freshman,

03:10.353 --> 03:11.353
I'm a Humanities student.

03:11.353 --> 03:12.152
Xu Zhi.

03:12.152 --> 03:12.953
Let me see.

03:13.112 --> 03:15.192
Turns out the girl
he's confessing to is you.

03:15.192 --> 03:15.913
Right now,

03:16.152 --> 03:17.472
I want to use a poem

03:17.472 --> 03:18.873
to express my feelings for you.

03:19.992 --> 03:21.672
A poem.

03:25.873 --> 03:27.192
I am

03:27.873 --> 03:29.472
a desperate person.

03:29.753 --> 03:30.753
Come back.

03:31.433 --> 03:32.833
Alright, stop looking.

03:32.833 --> 03:33.472
Get inside.

03:33.472 --> 03:34.472
Wait a moment.

03:34.552 --> 03:35.552
I'm grabbing my clothes.

03:35.833 --> 03:38.112
I remember what you looked last fall.

03:38.953 --> 03:39.673
Sorry.

03:39.673 --> 03:40.793
A gray beret.

03:40.793 --> 03:42.233
Si, I'm going down.

03:44.552 --> 03:45.152
Hello, Dad.

03:45.512 --> 03:46.592
Hello, Zhi.

03:47.873 --> 03:48.873
How's your leg?

03:49.512 --> 03:50.192
Much better.

03:50.353 --> 03:51.353
It doesn't hurt anymore.

03:52.672 --> 03:54.793
If it hurts again, don't ignore it.

03:55.072 --> 03:57.032
You must go to the hospital
for a check-up.

03:57.032 --> 03:59.313
On the barren land of mine,

04:00.753 --> 04:04.273
you are my last rose.

04:08.313 --> 04:09.632
Whose voice is that?

04:11.192 --> 04:12.353
Pretty loud, huh?

04:14.512 --> 04:15.713
A new suitor?

04:16.472 --> 04:17.472
Is he handsome?

04:17.833 --> 04:18.833
Which department?

04:18.992 --> 04:20.353
I don't know or care.

04:21.032 --> 04:22.992
Besides, can he be
as handsome as Chen Luzhou?

04:23.552 --> 04:25.353
Why compare the new guy with him?

04:25.953 --> 04:26.953
Get a new one.

04:28.192 --> 04:28.873
No, I don't.

04:28.992 --> 04:31.273
As a student of the Chinese department,
he's reciting

04:31.273 --> 04:32.472
someone else's poems.

04:33.433 --> 04:35.713
Not every place has romantic poets.

04:35.953 --> 04:37.032
That's right.

04:37.112 --> 04:38.913
Young people now
can't write better poetry

04:38.913 --> 04:40.472
than those in my day.

04:40.833 --> 04:41.833
You know what?

04:42.152 --> 04:44.273
Mr. Fu was once a renowned poet

04:44.273 --> 04:45.833
in our city.

04:46.072 --> 04:47.033
Although I don't know

04:47.033 --> 04:48.512
whether he wrote those poems

04:48.512 --> 04:49.992
or copied someone else's,

04:49.992 --> 04:53.032
he certainly enchanted

04:53.032 --> 04:54.512
a lot of artistic young women.

04:55.552 --> 04:57.632
You mean after Chen Luzhou gets old,

04:57.632 --> 04:59.313
he will be like Mr. Fu?

05:00.953 --> 05:01.953
It's possible.

05:02.273 --> 05:04.353
Then I should seriously
find a new boyfriend here.

05:04.472 --> 05:05.913
I'll keep my options open.

05:06.592 --> 05:07.592
Here you go.

05:07.713 --> 05:08.992
If you think that way,

05:09.192 --> 05:10.512
I'll feel relieved.

05:11.632 --> 05:12.713
Alright, I'm hanging up.

05:13.112 --> 05:13.816
Okay then.

05:13.816 --> 05:14.472
For you,

05:15.152 --> 05:19.072
I sing.

05:19.992 --> 05:20.753
Enough.

05:20.753 --> 05:21.753
Stop shouting.

05:23.112 --> 05:24.152
I am Xu Zhi's roommate.

05:25.192 --> 05:26.192
You like Xu Zhi?

05:30.632 --> 05:31.713
So far,

05:31.713 --> 05:33.632
there have been some guys
pursuing Xu Zhi.

05:34.032 --> 05:34.512
Listen.

05:34.753 --> 05:35.753
You go back.

05:35.833 --> 05:36.833
I'll get you in line.

05:37.072 --> 05:37.873
How about No. 8?

05:37.873 --> 05:38.873
Waiting in line?

05:38.992 --> 05:41.072
Wait, it depends on feelings.

05:41.152 --> 05:42.393
It's all about fate,

05:42.672 --> 05:43.913
not who comes first.

05:45.713 --> 05:46.992
You are quite confident.

05:49.433 --> 05:50.672
Have you heard of Jiang Yu?

05:51.953 --> 05:53.953
The sophomore
from the philosophy department...

05:53.953 --> 05:55.672
The hottest guy
in the Humanities Academy.

05:56.273 --> 05:57.353
He's in line too.

05:57.833 --> 05:58.632
Alright.

05:58.833 --> 05:59.873
Stop it and go.

06:00.512 --> 06:01.512
Get out of here.

06:01.873 --> 06:02.793
Get out of here.

06:02.793 --> 06:03.793
He's leaving?

06:04.873 --> 06:05.953
In our school,

06:06.433 --> 06:07.753
there are three boys to one girl.

06:07.753 --> 06:09.032
It's out of proportion.

06:09.353 --> 06:11.433
Girls like you are definitely

06:11.672 --> 06:12.992
in high demand.

06:12.992 --> 06:14.072
Please.

06:14.992 --> 06:16.273
But don't think of

06:16.273 --> 06:17.273
that loudspeaker guy.

06:17.753 --> 06:19.112
What about Jiang Yu?

06:19.112 --> 06:20.112
Do you like him?

06:20.353 --> 06:21.833
No, absolutely not.

06:22.512 --> 06:23.913
I don't have any feelings for him.

06:23.913 --> 06:25.273
Besides, I don't want to date now.

06:26.632 --> 06:27.632
What did I miss?

06:28.273 --> 06:28.833
Hey.

06:29.032 --> 06:29.673
Don't you think

06:29.673 --> 06:31.753
Jiang Yu and Xu Zhi make a great couple?

06:31.753 --> 06:33.433
- And he's so handsome.
- Yes.

06:34.192 --> 06:35.953
I really have no feelings for him.

06:35.953 --> 06:37.672
Besides, I don't want to date now.

06:38.112 --> 06:38.592
Tell me.

06:38.992 --> 06:40.471
Do you already like someone

06:40.600 --> 06:41.472
secretly?

06:45.072 --> 06:46.833
I dated someone
after high school graduation.

06:47.273 --> 06:48.753
But we broke up some time ago.

06:49.512 --> 06:51.192
Now, I'm focused on my studies

06:51.433 --> 06:52.433
to serve my country.

06:53.913 --> 06:55.953
These are my boyfriends
for the next four years.

06:57.672 --> 06:58.192
What?

06:58.433 --> 06:59.753
You dated before?

07:00.393 --> 07:02.112
Oh my, what kind of guy was he?

07:02.192 --> 07:03.192
Tell us about him.

07:03.353 --> 07:04.552
I'm so curious.

07:04.552 --> 07:05.913
What kind of person can

07:06.313 --> 07:07.472
win you over?

07:10.433 --> 07:11.512
A super hot guy.

07:11.512 --> 07:12.713
- A hot guy?
- A hot guy?

07:14.632 --> 07:15.632
That's it?

07:17.793 --> 07:19.072
It's actually very subjective

07:19.072 --> 07:20.112
to judge a person's looks.

07:20.393 --> 07:21.433
For example,

07:21.552 --> 07:22.672
I really think

07:23.072 --> 07:24.072
Jiang Yu is handsome.

07:24.433 --> 07:25.953
But you don't think so.

07:27.072 --> 07:29.233
Moreover,
beauty is in the eye of the beholder.

07:29.233 --> 07:30.632
Maybe her ex-boyfriend

07:30.632 --> 07:31.632
isn't handsome at all.

07:31.793 --> 07:33.353
Then, there's nothing I can say.

07:36.072 --> 07:38.032
It could be my personal problem.

07:39.233 --> 07:40.793
In my opinion, in today's world,

07:40.793 --> 07:41.873
bad guys are everywhere.

07:42.072 --> 07:43.112
Especially handsome guys.

07:43.632 --> 07:44.632
But I think

07:44.793 --> 07:46.273
Jiang Yu is very reliable.

07:46.433 --> 07:47.353
- I know.
- Yeah.

07:47.353 --> 07:48.353
Really.

07:49.552 --> 07:51.112
You should try hanging out with him.

07:51.672 --> 07:52.472
He's a good singer.

07:52.472 --> 07:52.992
How romantic.

07:52.992 --> 07:53.713
I know!

07:53.793 --> 07:54.992
How romantic is he?

07:55.273 --> 07:56.552
Like swinging on a toilet seat?

07:58.152 --> 08:00.433
I didn't expect this from you, Xu Zhi.

08:05.632 --> 08:07.913
(Free this Sunday, Artist?)

08:09.793 --> 08:10.833
I asked for you,

08:10.833 --> 08:11.833
and he said yes.

08:12.873 --> 08:13.992
Swinging on a toilet seat.

08:14.833 --> 08:16.112
Jiang Yu's free this weekend.

08:17.072 --> 08:18.072
Let's not.

08:18.152 --> 08:19.553
It's quite difficult.

08:20.992 --> 08:22.593
I think it's okay.

08:26.992 --> 08:28.473
Alright, let's wash up.

08:36.992 --> 08:37.992
These past two months,

08:38.072 --> 08:39.833
I've eaten with you guys quite a lot.

08:40.513 --> 08:42.593
Both you and Lucy aren't here now,

08:43.312 --> 08:45.913
so it's my first time
having a meal alone with Zhi.

08:46.312 --> 08:47.553
It feels a bit strange.

08:48.032 --> 08:49.432
Don't overthink it.

08:49.913 --> 08:52.072
Zhi must miss Chen Luzhou a lot.

08:52.432 --> 08:53.312
But she doesn't

08:53.432 --> 08:54.992
want to contact him actively.

08:55.192 --> 08:57.673
That's why she asked you out
to catch up.

08:58.553 --> 08:59.553
That's it.

08:59.992 --> 09:00.992
True.

09:01.992 --> 09:03.032
However, in my opinion,

09:03.953 --> 09:05.152
they'll make up eventually.

09:05.673 --> 09:06.992
Although both Zhi and Lucy

09:07.713 --> 09:09.432
look carefree on the surface,

09:11.352 --> 09:12.352
actually

09:12.513 --> 09:14.392
they haven't let go at all.

09:18.473 --> 09:20.352
Look, I've worked out quite well, right?

09:20.753 --> 09:21.753
Look at my biceps.

09:22.553 --> 09:23.953
Stylish Zhu, move aside a bit.

09:24.152 --> 09:26.392
Let me see the one behind you.

09:28.553 --> 09:28.953
Right.

09:29.112 --> 09:30.112
Fine.

09:32.112 --> 09:33.713
Not bad.

09:34.833 --> 09:36.312
Bye, I need to train.

09:36.593 --> 09:38.072
- Bye.
- Why hang up?

09:51.072 --> 09:52.112
Hey.

09:52.112 --> 09:53.112
Zhi.

09:53.352 --> 09:54.352
Let's go.

09:54.553 --> 09:56.032
This place is really good.

09:56.392 --> 09:57.392
I booked a private room.

09:57.633 --> 09:57.992
Here.

09:58.633 --> 09:59.953
Hello, this way please.

10:03.513 --> 10:04.673
I'm starving.

10:08.633 --> 10:09.673
Let me see the menu.

10:09.673 --> 10:10.312
Here.

10:10.312 --> 10:11.312
Okay.

10:12.873 --> 10:13.873
Thank you.

10:15.232 --> 10:16.232
Trust me.

10:17.272 --> 10:19.112
One sashimi platter, please.

10:19.232 --> 10:20.992
And then two eel rice bowls, please.

10:22.152 --> 10:22.793
Alright.

10:22.873 --> 10:23.873
Please wait a moment.

10:27.192 --> 10:28.192
You've been working out?

10:28.793 --> 10:29.793
Isn't it obvious?

10:30.432 --> 10:31.432
I'm not bragging.

10:32.112 --> 10:33.192
Others work out for a year

10:33.192 --> 10:34.432
and still can't reach my level.

10:34.673 --> 10:35.673
It took me only a month

10:36.152 --> 10:37.673
to undergo a new transformation.

10:37.992 --> 10:38.513
See that?

10:38.593 --> 10:39.593
Yes.

10:40.112 --> 10:41.112
Well...

10:41.793 --> 10:42.873
Can you change back?

10:44.392 --> 10:45.593
The way you are now is a bit

10:45.713 --> 10:46.873
too much.

10:47.793 --> 10:48.793
Too...

10:49.072 --> 10:50.432
Why is that?

10:51.192 --> 10:52.473
Even Cai Yingying said

10:52.953 --> 10:54.272
that guys with pecs

10:54.513 --> 10:56.272
make her feel secure.

10:56.513 --> 10:57.513
Here's the thing.

10:57.992 --> 10:59.032
The standard

10:59.032 --> 11:00.633
for guys and girls about muscles

11:00.633 --> 11:01.633
are different.

11:01.793 --> 11:03.673
We like the kind
that looks slim in clothes

11:03.673 --> 11:04.673
yet defined naked.

11:05.633 --> 11:08.513
It seems most girls don't like it when

11:08.513 --> 11:09.992
a guy's chest is bigger than theirs.

11:11.633 --> 11:13.272
They find it quite unattractive.

11:15.032 --> 11:15.553
Then I

11:15.992 --> 11:16.953
shouldn't bulk up.

11:16.953 --> 11:17.953
I need to lost weight.

11:18.992 --> 11:19.713
Waiter,

11:19.873 --> 11:20.913
cancel the eel rice.

11:21.152 --> 11:21.713
Alright.

11:21.833 --> 11:22.833
Thank you.

11:30.432 --> 11:32.352
Do you miss him?

11:35.352 --> 11:36.593
I got your message yesterday,

11:37.232 --> 11:38.873
and knew you somewhat missed him.

11:39.312 --> 11:41.352
Otherwise, you wouldn't
have reached out to me.

11:46.152 --> 11:47.152
Thank you.

12:02.953 --> 12:03.992
This is quite strong.

12:17.593 --> 12:18.593
Come quickly!

12:19.833 --> 12:20.833
Why?

12:21.112 --> 12:22.112
Try it.

12:22.992 --> 12:23.992
Try what?

12:26.232 --> 12:27.232
Here you go.

12:28.673 --> 12:29.673
What's this?

12:30.032 --> 12:32.072
This is my grandma's
homemade liquor, look.

12:33.112 --> 12:33.834
It's very tasty.

12:33.834 --> 12:35.072
Drinking in broad daylight?

12:36.753 --> 12:37.513
You know what?

12:37.513 --> 12:38.473
Dad won't even let

12:38.473 --> 12:39.474
Mr. Cai have a sip.

12:39.474 --> 12:41.112
I stole it, so give it a try.

12:48.953 --> 12:49.953
Is it good?

12:53.793 --> 12:54.264
You...

12:54.753 --> 12:55.753
Are you messing with me?

12:56.633 --> 12:57.992
Don't pinch my face.

12:57.992 --> 12:59.513
If it swells up, then it's your fault.

12:59.633 --> 13:01.152
Fine, my fault.

13:01.152 --> 13:02.593
You dare talk about responsibility.

13:03.072 --> 13:05.072
You take responsibility
for kissing me that much?

13:05.793 --> 13:06.833
I don't have to.

13:07.072 --> 13:08.232
Why not?

13:08.432 --> 13:09.953
Because I said so.

13:09.953 --> 13:11.392
You take a sip. It's not good.

13:15.072 --> 13:16.072
Actually,

13:18.793 --> 13:20.072
I've been in Beijing this long,

13:20.272 --> 13:21.553
but I'm hesitant to contact you.

13:22.152 --> 13:23.152
Mainly, I'm afraid

13:23.392 --> 13:25.152
you'll think of him when you see me.

13:30.152 --> 13:31.593
Why are you staring at me like that?

13:32.192 --> 13:33.392
See if I can remember him.

13:39.232 --> 13:40.593
I heard there's a handsome guy

13:40.593 --> 13:41.593
named Jiang Yu.

13:42.513 --> 13:43.553
Is he as handsome as me?

13:44.392 --> 13:45.992
How do you know Jiang Yu?

13:46.473 --> 13:47.513
I have informants.

13:53.192 --> 13:54.312
How many informants

13:54.312 --> 13:56.192
did Chen Luzhou deploy around me?

13:56.593 --> 13:57.793
Did he ask you to spy on me?

13:57.793 --> 13:58.793
Your dishes.

14:08.272 --> 14:09.312
No.

14:10.272 --> 14:12.633
When your grades came out,
he knew you'd go to Huaguang.

14:12.913 --> 14:13.794
So, he asked me

14:13.794 --> 14:15.713
to keep an eye on you,

14:16.112 --> 14:17.112
lest you be bullied.

14:17.833 --> 14:18.833
It's not spying.

14:19.673 --> 14:20.953
So, how exactly is Jiang Yu?

14:21.392 --> 14:22.553
Is he as handsome as Lucy?

14:26.032 --> 14:27.112
What exactly does he mean?

14:29.593 --> 14:31.032
Xu Zhi, don't take me wrong.

14:31.032 --> 14:32.232
He doesn't mean anything.

14:32.352 --> 14:34.392
He really just wanted me
to keep an eye on you.

14:34.673 --> 14:36.112
He's just afraid you'll be bullied.

14:36.992 --> 14:37.992
He also said

14:38.112 --> 14:39.873
you could even date other people.

14:50.673 --> 14:51.272
Xu Zhi,

14:51.673 --> 14:52.673
let me tell you.

14:53.192 --> 14:54.192
I think,

14:54.713 --> 14:57.032
constantly looking
for his shadow in others

14:57.152 --> 14:58.152
really isn't good.

15:02.032 --> 15:03.112
Why not

15:03.833 --> 15:05.112
try getting into a relationship?

15:06.112 --> 15:07.953
After all, Lucy is abroad,

15:08.992 --> 15:10.513
and won't be back soon.

15:12.232 --> 15:13.232
I think you

15:13.392 --> 15:15.432
can't keep dragging it out like this.

15:21.473 --> 15:22.473
You're right.

15:37.593 --> 15:38.433
Where's Mr. Handsome?

15:38.433 --> 15:39.553
Where?

15:39.833 --> 15:40.192
There.

15:40.192 --> 15:40.753
Which one?

15:40.753 --> 15:41.313
Over there.

15:41.313 --> 15:42.873
- He's really handsome.
- Cute.

15:43.793 --> 15:44.633
He's so handsome.

15:44.633 --> 15:45.634
If models were like this,

15:45.634 --> 15:47.432
then I'd come to art class every day.

15:49.032 --> 15:49.793
When did he arrive?

15:50.032 --> 15:51.072
Really handsome.

15:53.992 --> 15:54.992
You're finally here.

15:56.272 --> 15:57.833
You're back this soon.

16:00.753 --> 16:01.833
Are you back as a model?

16:02.112 --> 16:02.633
No.

16:02.992 --> 16:04.232
They said this is your spot.

16:04.352 --> 16:05.352
So, I was waiting here.

16:07.473 --> 16:08.473
So handsome.

16:10.032 --> 16:11.673
He isn't a model.

16:11.873 --> 16:13.112
This is my bro, Lucy.

16:13.232 --> 16:15.713
He finally came back
from Europe to see me.

16:17.673 --> 16:19.432
Since you're here, let's go eat.

16:19.873 --> 16:20.673
But you have class.

16:20.793 --> 16:22.152
You're more important.

16:22.553 --> 16:23.553
He left.

16:23.673 --> 16:24.432
Better at drawing?

16:24.673 --> 16:25.673
Tell me about it.

16:27.873 --> 16:29.312
Not a model?

16:29.553 --> 16:30.833
I haven't seen enough yet.

16:34.032 --> 16:35.032
Aren't you working out?

16:35.232 --> 16:36.032
Have some meat

16:36.032 --> 16:37.032
to gain weight.

16:37.192 --> 16:38.312
I don't need to gain weight.

16:38.312 --> 16:39.312
I need to lose weight.

16:39.473 --> 16:40.473
I have to eat greens.

16:40.833 --> 16:42.352
You're losing weight eating skewers?

16:42.753 --> 16:43.793
What else then?

16:43.793 --> 16:44.793
Eat salad every day?

16:44.913 --> 16:46.032
How bland that is.

16:47.352 --> 16:48.553
Just like today's lunch.

16:48.713 --> 16:50.753
The Japanese food Xu Zhi and I ate was

16:51.392 --> 16:53.232
so expensive and yet tasteless.

16:57.553 --> 16:59.192
You haven't seen Xu Zhi yet, have you?

16:59.713 --> 17:01.192
She didn't mention you earlier.

17:03.873 --> 17:05.192
I went to Huaguang University.

17:05.833 --> 17:06.833
But I didn't tell her.

17:07.473 --> 17:08.473
Why not?

17:10.072 --> 17:11.473
I took the waitlist admission test.

17:12.152 --> 17:13.473
But the results are not out yet.

17:14.112 --> 17:15.513
Before the results are confirmed,

17:15.793 --> 17:16.793
I don't want her to know.

17:17.352 --> 17:18.633
Waitlist admission?

17:19.352 --> 17:20.593
You don't have to leave then?

17:21.992 --> 17:22.992
Nice.

17:25.833 --> 17:26.392
Hold on.

17:26.513 --> 17:27.593
Did your family agree?

17:28.753 --> 17:30.432
Didn't you always say
I was a mama's boy?

17:31.032 --> 17:32.793
From today on, I'll listen to no one

17:33.392 --> 17:34.432
but myself.

17:36.192 --> 17:37.192
Nice.

17:37.432 --> 17:38.713
Good for you.

17:39.553 --> 17:40.192
Right now,

17:40.553 --> 17:42.633
you dare to say no to your mom.

17:42.953 --> 17:44.072
That's how it should be.

17:44.553 --> 17:45.553
Bro, give me a hug.

17:46.312 --> 17:47.032
You're crazy.

17:47.232 --> 17:48.272
Come on.

17:48.272 --> 17:49.272
Get off.

17:49.953 --> 17:51.072
Wait a minute, you...

17:56.272 --> 17:57.992
Got some girl stuff after going abroad?

17:57.992 --> 17:58.992
What's this?

17:59.072 --> 18:00.072
Why do you care?

18:00.192 --> 18:01.272
Is it Xu Zhi's?

18:02.793 --> 18:03.793
Lucy.

18:04.192 --> 18:05.833
You're not a mama's boy now.

18:05.992 --> 18:07.473
You're lovesick.

18:08.152 --> 18:08.754
Anyway,

18:08.754 --> 18:10.152
my return must be kept a secret.

18:10.793 --> 18:12.392
Don't let it slip to Cai Yingying.

18:26.473 --> 18:27.473
Lucy.

18:28.152 --> 18:29.793
As for Xu Zhi, I can keep it secret.

18:29.953 --> 18:30.953
However,

18:31.833 --> 18:32.833
I think you living alone

18:32.833 --> 18:33.833
is a bit too lonely.

18:34.392 --> 18:34.913
Here.

18:35.392 --> 18:36.392
I'll stay with you.

18:37.553 --> 18:39.072
We can chat

18:39.072 --> 18:40.072
like we used to.

18:46.673 --> 18:47.873
Alright, it's just that...

18:47.873 --> 18:48.794
My roommate

18:48.794 --> 18:50.032
really drives me crazy.

18:50.352 --> 18:53.593
He doesn't shower
or wash his feet every day.

18:53.593 --> 18:54.713
He has smelly feet,

18:54.713 --> 18:55.713
and puts it near my head.

18:55.793 --> 18:56.633
I can't stand it.

18:56.713 --> 18:57.713
I'm almost breaking down.

18:59.232 --> 19:00.312
We split the utility bills.

19:02.152 --> 19:03.753
Come on, eat up.

19:03.873 --> 19:05.112
It's on me, alright?

19:05.633 --> 19:06.633
Waiter,

19:06.713 --> 19:07.352
more dishes.

19:07.473 --> 19:08.473
Alright.

19:09.473 --> 19:10.473
Come on.

19:11.736 --> 19:13.232
See what more you'd like to eat.

19:22.633 --> 19:23.633
Xu Zhi, how is it?

19:25.753 --> 19:27.753
Isn't it just a class?

19:28.553 --> 19:29.953
This is Professor Wang's class.

19:30.112 --> 19:31.873
Many people fail calculus each year.

19:32.152 --> 19:33.033
You never know.

19:33.033 --> 19:34.312
This might

19:34.312 --> 19:35.553
hold me back from graduating.

19:35.833 --> 19:37.392
I want to give him a good impression.

19:37.513 --> 19:38.633
I think it's unlikely.

19:38.633 --> 19:40.312
You look like you're selling insurance.

19:40.513 --> 19:41.513
Xu Zhi.

19:41.713 --> 19:42.713
I'm going to be angry.

19:44.833 --> 19:46.072
It's Professor Wang's class.

19:46.272 --> 19:47.513
You two still dare to be late?

19:49.112 --> 19:51.112
In our freshman year,

19:51.232 --> 19:52.473
we wouldn't even eat lunch.

19:52.713 --> 19:54.553
We'd go straight
to the classroom and wait.

19:56.112 --> 19:57.432
Professor Wang is that harsh?

19:57.633 --> 19:59.312
Wang is a man of character.

19:59.833 --> 20:01.953
Unless you are really capable,

20:02.352 --> 20:04.673
you don't need him for
the key points for the final exam.

20:05.072 --> 20:07.352
Otherwise, watch your attitude.

20:07.473 --> 20:08.833
He might just fail you directly.

20:09.793 --> 20:11.832
Let's hurry up, don't be late.

20:11.832 --> 20:12.633
Go, quickly!

20:13.473 --> 20:14.232
Run faster.

20:14.312 --> 20:16.352
If Xu Zhi is asked
for WeChat on the way,

20:16.352 --> 20:17.352
you'll be late for sure.

20:29.392 --> 20:30.392
Go.

20:32.713 --> 20:34.953
Jiang Yu asked me to save seats for you.

20:34.953 --> 20:35.593
Thank you.

20:35.953 --> 20:36.953
You're welcome.

20:41.392 --> 20:42.992
Senior Jiang Yu?

20:43.232 --> 20:44.392
When were you guys a thing?

20:44.392 --> 20:45.392
You didn't even tell me.

20:45.793 --> 20:46.794
Tell your boyfriend

20:46.794 --> 20:48.112
to save a seat in the front row.

20:48.513 --> 20:49.992
Impression points, you know.

20:49.992 --> 20:51.032
He's not my boyfriend.

20:51.753 --> 20:53.072
Next time, let's come earlier.

20:53.432 --> 20:55.352
Sorry, I couldn't save seats.

20:55.473 --> 20:56.152
It's okay.

20:56.352 --> 20:57.352
Class begin.

20:57.553 --> 20:58.553
Hello, guys.

20:58.753 --> 21:01.833
Hello, sir.

21:01.833 --> 21:04.032
Please open to page 27 of the book.

21:06.793 --> 21:07.793
This question...

21:10.032 --> 21:11.112
Xu Gongzhu,

21:11.112 --> 21:12.272
please answer this question.

21:22.152 --> 21:24.152
Same order but not equivalent,
infinitesimal.

21:26.432 --> 21:27.432
That's right.

21:28.272 --> 21:29.473
This is the topic

21:29.992 --> 21:31.352
we need to learn this class.

21:32.192 --> 21:33.312
It seems some students

21:33.553 --> 21:35.112
have done their preparation carefully.

21:35.953 --> 21:36.673
In my class,

21:36.913 --> 21:39.192
I hope everyone will prepare diligently.

21:40.032 --> 21:41.032
Please sit down.

21:41.432 --> 21:44.192
I'll definitely fail.

21:44.432 --> 21:45.992
Will I not be able to graduate?

21:46.473 --> 21:48.432
It's okay if you
don't know the prep material.

21:48.873 --> 21:49.873
Do you know it then?

21:51.232 --> 21:52.272
Figures.

21:53.953 --> 21:58.072
I heard other departments
have additional enrollment slots.

21:58.232 --> 21:59.992
They've missed
a month's worth of classes.

22:00.072 --> 22:01.953
I'm afraid everyone will pass,
except me.

22:02.072 --> 22:03.072
That won't do.

22:03.392 --> 22:03.953
No.

22:04.232 --> 22:05.392
I must pass.

22:05.593 --> 22:06.432
I can't fail.

22:06.553 --> 22:07.273
I'm begging.

22:07.273 --> 22:08.553
I can't fail.

22:09.152 --> 22:10.152
You can do it.

22:11.793 --> 22:13.192
He definitely remembers me.

22:13.793 --> 22:14.913
What should I do?

22:15.192 --> 22:16.432
Lift your foot.

22:16.992 --> 22:18.793
No, your butt.

22:18.992 --> 22:19.992
You might as well get up.

22:23.992 --> 22:24.593
Alright.

22:24.593 --> 22:25.593
What's this?

22:25.913 --> 22:26.953
Lucky color.

22:27.152 --> 22:29.432
You'll definitely make it.

22:43.736 --> 22:45.752
(College Entrance Examination Results)

22:50.553 --> 22:51.553
Wait.

22:51.873 --> 22:52.873
There's something.

22:58.072 --> 22:59.112
Everything goes well.

23:02.633 --> 23:03.633
Hold on a moment.

23:04.192 --> 23:05.192
There's another thing.

23:06.833 --> 23:08.913
May all your wishes come true.

23:11.032 --> 23:11.768
Is there more?

23:11.953 --> 23:13.232
If not, I'm going to check.

23:13.673 --> 23:14.673
Go ahead.

23:23.032 --> 23:24.032
How is it?

23:26.432 --> 23:27.953
How is it? Tell me!

23:30.513 --> 23:31.633
Say something!

23:34.793 --> 23:35.793
No good?

23:36.793 --> 23:37.793
Impossible.

23:39.832 --> 23:41.224
(Successful)

23:43.513 --> 23:44.793
You made it.

23:47.633 --> 23:49.992
I'm more nervous
checking your grades than my own.

23:50.833 --> 23:52.633
Stop with this in the future, Lucy.

23:52.633 --> 23:54.232
My heart can't take it.

23:55.352 --> 23:56.753
You can finally tell Zhi now.

23:57.953 --> 23:58.953
No rush.

23:59.553 --> 24:01.112
Let me finish my current work first.

24:02.072 --> 24:03.593
You got into Huaguang University, bro.

24:03.593 --> 24:05.312
Why are you still working?

24:05.312 --> 24:07.112
Let's go have a good meal to celebrate.

24:07.473 --> 24:08.793
I got into Huaguang University.

24:08.992 --> 24:10.432
Will you pay my tuition?

24:11.793 --> 24:12.793
Oh, right.

24:13.032 --> 24:14.192
I won't be back this noon.

24:14.272 --> 24:15.312
You handle lunch yourself.

24:15.833 --> 24:16.713
Alright.

24:16.793 --> 24:18.112
Then take care, bye.

24:18.713 --> 24:19.713
Okay.

24:23.673 --> 24:24.953
To challenge Her Majesty,

24:25.072 --> 24:26.553
you're actually supporting yourself.

24:26.633 --> 24:27.913
Even paying your college fee.

24:28.793 --> 24:29.913
Lucy, oh Lucy,

24:30.232 --> 24:31.953
you're simply too impressive.

24:35.593 --> 24:36.593
Hurry.

24:36.953 --> 24:37.593
Be careful.

24:37.593 --> 24:38.593
Go.

24:39.633 --> 24:40.152
Oh, my gosh,

24:40.152 --> 24:40.873
raining this hard?

24:40.873 --> 24:41.754
This weather changes.

24:41.754 --> 24:42.793
Such terrible weather.

24:42.992 --> 24:43.992
I'm all wet.

24:47.593 --> 24:48.593
Where's my phone?

24:49.793 --> 24:50.793
Good that it's raining.

24:50.913 --> 24:53.072
The client wants a shot
of the mountain lodge.

24:53.272 --> 24:54.272
Who'll go for it?

24:54.673 --> 24:55.913
A 500 bonus for one shot.

24:57.192 --> 24:57.954
Only 500?

24:57.954 --> 24:59.032
500 for a shot?

24:59.032 --> 25:00.392
Must go to the mountain top.

25:00.553 --> 25:01.273
It's slippery.

25:01.273 --> 25:02.713
It won't cover the medical expenses.

25:02.833 --> 25:03.914
- Should be 5,000.
- Yeah.

25:03.914 --> 25:05.112
500 for one shot.

25:05.593 --> 25:06.593
That's too cheap.

25:07.553 --> 25:08.553
I'll go.

25:10.793 --> 25:12.032
Eager to show off this young.

25:12.032 --> 25:13.513
- Exactly.
- Can you believe it?

25:14.352 --> 25:15.392
What's he after?

25:15.593 --> 25:16.793
He looks like a rich kid.

25:16.793 --> 25:17.553
See his clothes?

25:17.553 --> 25:18.553
Exactly.

25:20.192 --> 25:21.392
They're all designer brands.

25:22.633 --> 25:24.192
He even competes for 500.

25:24.432 --> 25:25.473
He's here for the thrill.

25:25.473 --> 25:26.753
500 can't cover dry-cleaning.

25:26.953 --> 25:27.953
Yeah.

25:34.713 --> 25:36.793
Interested in joining
the student council?

25:37.633 --> 25:38.833
With a personality like yours,

25:38.833 --> 25:40.272
you'd be perfect for the presidency.

25:40.753 --> 25:42.392
When departments start to fight,

25:42.392 --> 25:44.032
someone needs to oversee the situation.

25:44.272 --> 25:45.272
You can definitely

25:45.272 --> 25:46.272
handle it.

25:46.593 --> 25:47.593
Forget it.

25:47.793 --> 25:49.753
We've been having late night meetings.

25:49.753 --> 25:50.753
My head hurts.

25:50.913 --> 25:52.232
There isn't any important work.

25:52.593 --> 25:53.793
I still have to report daily.

25:53.793 --> 25:54.873
Too formalistic.

25:55.593 --> 25:57.152
I wouldn't have joined any department.

25:59.873 --> 26:00.873
Alright.

26:02.192 --> 26:02.793
What's up?

26:02.793 --> 26:03.793
Not doing anything.

26:03.992 --> 26:04.992
Snatching people for you.

26:11.312 --> 26:12.312
Why are you avoiding me?

26:12.833 --> 26:14.392
You stepped on my shadow.

26:16.992 --> 26:17.992
Okay.

26:18.232 --> 26:19.232
I'll walk behind you.

26:20.713 --> 26:21.713
Now you step on me.

26:36.553 --> 26:38.152
I have something to do, bye.

26:46.593 --> 26:47.593
Are you going home

26:47.913 --> 26:48.913
for National Day?

26:49.713 --> 26:51.072
Do you need me for any work?

26:52.473 --> 26:53.513
There's something.

26:53.513 --> 26:54.713
It's fine if you go home.

26:56.152 --> 26:57.913
It's just after the holiday,

26:57.913 --> 27:00.432
the competition arrangements
haven't been settled yet.

27:01.152 --> 27:02.633
Basketball and photography contests.

27:02.633 --> 27:04.633
Art exhibitions and more.

27:05.873 --> 27:08.032
Our posters are outdated.

27:08.112 --> 27:10.513
There are some edits

27:10.833 --> 27:11.953
that are not yet completed.

27:12.392 --> 27:13.873
If you're not going home,

27:14.513 --> 27:16.392
I'd like you to work overtime.

27:16.513 --> 27:17.513
Is that okay?

27:18.072 --> 27:19.473
Then leave the key with me.

27:20.713 --> 27:21.713
I'll join you.

27:21.816 --> 27:22.353
After that,

27:22.353 --> 27:23.833
I'll take you to a concert.

27:25.593 --> 27:26.593
No.

27:26.873 --> 27:28.152
My bestie is visiting.

27:28.152 --> 27:29.192
I have to stay with her.

27:29.392 --> 27:30.432
Probably can't work.

27:31.473 --> 27:33.392
What about the concert then?

27:36.873 --> 27:37.873
Actually, Senior,

27:38.152 --> 27:39.192
I added you on WeChat

27:39.192 --> 27:41.473
because your profile picture
looks like a friend of mine.

27:41.713 --> 27:42.913
I thought it was him.

27:43.392 --> 27:45.312
Also, I don't intend to date.

27:49.032 --> 27:50.312
Profile picture?

27:51.753 --> 27:53.473
Is it your ex-boyfriend
from high school?

27:54.473 --> 27:55.473
Yes.

27:56.152 --> 27:57.553
What kind of person is he?

27:58.192 --> 27:59.753
You still haven't blacklisted him.

28:00.913 --> 28:01.913
He's a punk.

29:20.913 --> 29:22.272
Your new Beijing number.

29:22.272 --> 29:23.272
Where did you buy it?

29:25.432 --> 29:27.392
There's a business office
next to No.2 canteen.

29:38.953 --> 29:39.953
How much left?

29:40.112 --> 29:41.112
Gonna finish it tonight?

29:41.392 --> 29:43.513
I have to pull an all-nighter
and finish it.

29:44.272 --> 29:46.432
Our department has a lot of chores.

29:46.753 --> 29:48.072
I can't even study.

29:48.873 --> 29:50.192
No worries, I'm with you.

29:55.352 --> 29:56.753
We'll fight till dawn.

29:57.152 --> 29:58.953
It shouldn't be that serious.

29:59.352 --> 30:01.232
You're spreading anxiety.

30:02.072 --> 30:03.072
What do you know?

30:03.432 --> 30:06.473
Late-night snacks are the best.

30:07.753 --> 30:08.753
Come on, cheers.

30:08.753 --> 30:09.753
Cheers!

30:14.753 --> 30:15.753
Keep it up!

30:26.593 --> 30:27.713
(Today's Media)
Send this to Finance.

30:30.152 --> 30:31.152
Hello, boss.

30:46.072 --> 30:47.072
Not bad.

30:47.513 --> 30:48.513
Caught on quickly.

30:48.953 --> 30:50.473
Thanks to you for this shoot.

30:52.633 --> 30:53.633
Everyone, take a look.

30:54.593 --> 30:56.673
Chen is already leaving

30:57.032 --> 30:58.713
but still works diligently.

30:59.112 --> 31:01.152
If everyone could be like him,

31:01.432 --> 31:02.432
then our company

31:02.593 --> 31:04.352
would grow strong.

31:04.593 --> 31:06.232
- Yes, boss.
- Yes, boss.

31:08.232 --> 31:09.232
Chen.

31:09.513 --> 31:11.753
The company lacks talents like you.

31:12.473 --> 31:13.793
You're welcome to come back.

31:14.312 --> 31:15.793
For future outsourcing gigs,

31:16.192 --> 31:17.192
you'll be my No.1 option.

31:17.513 --> 31:18.513
Thank you, boss.

31:19.192 --> 31:20.073
You need to pay me

31:20.073 --> 31:21.232
for this project.

31:21.232 --> 31:22.713
And my bonus, 500.

31:24.913 --> 31:25.873
Absolutely.

31:25.873 --> 31:26.873
Thank you.

31:32.120 --> 31:36.120
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

31:36.120 --> 31:39.458
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

31:40.056 --> 31:41.880
♪Can beat the night♪

31:42.136 --> 31:45.796
♪We can outrun time♪

31:46.456 --> 31:49.853
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

31:50.328 --> 31:54.401
♪All blend into our season♪

32:04.024 --> 32:06.221
♪When the summer breeze blows♪

32:06.904 --> 32:10.404
♪We don't think about the fallen leaves♪

32:10.404 --> 32:13.472
♪Just want to remember this moment♪

32:14.168 --> 32:17.648
♪With you, I actually
start looking forward to rainy days♪

32:18.264 --> 32:23.006
♪You are like an umbrella,
always catching the raindrops♪

32:23.192 --> 32:26.795
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

32:26.968 --> 32:30.609
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

32:30.904 --> 32:34.584
♪All blend into our season♪

32:34.584 --> 32:36.833
♪The cicadas' chirping
seems to never cease♪

32:37.560 --> 32:41.010
♪The years we have spent♪

32:41.010 --> 32:44.034
♪Also seem to have no end♪

32:44.792 --> 32:48.463
♪Only you know everything about me,
no words needed♪

32:48.952 --> 32:54.040
♪My equation,
you always have the solution♪

32:54.936 --> 32:58.933
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

32:59.224 --> 33:02.629
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

33:02.968 --> 33:04.951
♪Can beat the night♪

33:05.112 --> 33:08.896
♪We can outrun time♪

33:09.368 --> 33:12.572
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

33:13.208 --> 33:17.208
♪All blend into our season♪

33:17.208 --> 33:19.513
♪No matter how the future changes♪

33:19.513 --> 33:20.152
Good morning.

33:20.152 --> 33:20.673
Hello.

33:21.072 --> 33:22.953
One meat bun and soy milk.

33:22.953 --> 33:23.953
Okay.

33:25.833 --> 33:26.352
Go ahead.

33:26.833 --> 33:27.833
Thank you.

33:32.553 --> 33:33.553
Thank you.

33:34.232 --> 33:34.833
Thank you.

33:34.833 --> 33:35.833
You're welcome.

33:35.992 --> 33:39.452
♪We'll turn our backs
on youth together and take risks♪

33:39.932 --> 33:43.407
♪Let all the sadness and joy♪

33:43.896 --> 33:48.377
♪All blend into our season♪

33:54.136 --> 33:58.072
♪Make you forget all your rules♪

33:58.553 --> 33:59.673
Who is it?

34:01.432 --> 34:02.833
Disturbing people this early.

34:02.833 --> 34:05.232
I'll call the police to arrest you.

34:07.112 --> 34:08.112
Surprise!

34:09.272 --> 34:10.272
Happy to see me?

34:11.793 --> 34:12.713
Help me carry this.

34:12.713 --> 34:13.713
I...

34:13.833 --> 34:14.833
I'm exhausted.

34:15.793 --> 34:16.793
Wait.

34:18.473 --> 34:19.593
How did you know about here?

34:20.392 --> 34:22.473
Did you forget the admission brochure
you sent me?

34:24.072 --> 34:26.152
Zhu, this is not bad.

34:28.713 --> 34:30.473
This time I came to Beijing
for training.

34:30.713 --> 34:32.112
I deliberately didn't tell you.

34:32.192 --> 34:33.513
It's a surprise.

34:34.593 --> 34:35.793
It is quite a surprise.

34:36.713 --> 34:37.992
Quickly call Xu Zhi over.

34:38.072 --> 34:39.152
I'll pretend to do delivery

34:39.152 --> 34:39.833
and surprise her.

34:39.833 --> 34:40.833
Call her here?

34:41.232 --> 34:42.232
No.

34:42.392 --> 34:43.473
Why not?

34:43.913 --> 34:44.913
I said no.

34:45.953 --> 34:46.953
What's wrong?

34:47.152 --> 34:48.633
Drink some water, come on.

34:51.953 --> 34:53.312
Two cups of instant noodles.

34:54.553 --> 34:55.553
Come on.

34:58.312 --> 35:00.032
You're in a relationship?

35:01.272 --> 35:02.272
You!

35:03.112 --> 35:04.192
No, this...

35:04.192 --> 35:05.713
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

35:05.713 --> 35:05.914
No.

35:05.914 --> 35:07.513
It's inappropriate for me to be here.

35:07.513 --> 35:08.513
Not at all.

35:09.272 --> 35:10.593
Your girlfriend is back.

35:12.272 --> 35:12.873
Not my...

35:13.152 --> 35:14.232
Hurry up.

35:18.072 --> 35:19.633
Why not lock the door, Zhu Yangqi?

35:20.473 --> 35:21.473
Up so early today?

35:25.152 --> 35:26.593
Chen Luzhou.

35:27.432 --> 35:28.432
Cai Yingying?

35:31.072 --> 35:32.913
Aren't you supposed to be abroad?

35:37.352 --> 35:38.593
Don't tell Xu Zhi

35:38.593 --> 35:40.873
that Lucy came back to Beijing.

35:41.513 --> 35:42.953
How could that be possible?

35:42.953 --> 35:44.392
Sisterhood comes before anything.

35:44.392 --> 35:45.673
There are no secrets between us.

35:45.753 --> 35:46.793
Cai Yingying.

35:46.793 --> 35:47.793
Don't call her yet.

35:48.072 --> 35:49.673
I'll tell her when the time is right.

35:56.072 --> 35:57.072
Fine.

35:57.192 --> 35:58.392
Then you better hurry up.

35:58.392 --> 35:59.392
I can't hold it in long.

36:00.312 --> 36:01.312
Thanks.

36:03.032 --> 36:05.152
Since I did you a favor,

36:05.673 --> 36:06.793
you help me with one too.

36:07.553 --> 36:08.553
Me?

36:08.873 --> 36:09.873
Sure.

36:10.713 --> 36:11.713
I...

36:12.753 --> 36:13.753
Thanks.

36:19.352 --> 36:20.833
So you ask me out for no reason?

36:21.072 --> 36:22.072
Of course.

36:22.072 --> 36:23.073
You treated me last time.

36:23.073 --> 36:24.112
It's my turn now.

36:26.392 --> 36:28.192
Can I have a hug?

36:28.352 --> 36:28.953
Give a hug.

36:28.953 --> 36:29.633
Just give a hug.

36:29.633 --> 36:30.633
You hug.

36:30.713 --> 36:31.713
I'll hug.

36:36.192 --> 36:36.833
Are you okay?

36:37.032 --> 36:38.032
You okay?

36:38.352 --> 36:39.513
Zhi.

36:39.513 --> 36:40.633
Yingying.

36:47.673 --> 36:48.992
That hurts.

36:48.992 --> 36:49.754
Stop it.

36:49.754 --> 36:51.432
Went all this way to surprise a friend,

36:51.432 --> 36:52.593
only to be horribly rejected.

36:52.593 --> 36:53.753
Tell me, can I not feel hurt?

36:53.913 --> 36:54.673
Let's go eat.

36:54.673 --> 36:55.673
Let's go.

36:57.673 --> 36:58.713
Wait for me.

36:59.232 --> 37:00.232
I'm still here.

37:06.793 --> 37:08.152
Zhi, you have no idea.

37:08.352 --> 37:10.673
Repeating these classes
is simply unbearable.

37:10.793 --> 37:12.032
It's harder than senior year.

37:12.432 --> 37:13.432
Really?

37:14.072 --> 37:16.192
Weren't you quite happy in senior year?

37:17.112 --> 37:18.913
You really know how to chat.

37:20.673 --> 37:21.873
Did I ever tell you

37:21.873 --> 37:23.272
that Tan Xu and I are classmates?

37:24.673 --> 37:25.713
How's he doing?

37:26.513 --> 37:27.112
Not so well.

37:27.432 --> 37:29.032
He didn't do well in the last mock exam.

37:29.112 --> 37:31.112
His parents hurried to school
and scolded him,

37:31.232 --> 37:33.352
saying he's worthless.

37:35.392 --> 37:37.072
So, his gaslighting

37:37.072 --> 37:38.473
runs in the family?

37:39.192 --> 37:40.192
So, you know,

37:40.432 --> 37:42.833
people who are hateful are pathetic.

37:47.272 --> 37:48.272
Does it still hurt?

37:49.312 --> 37:50.392
It's much better now.

37:51.793 --> 37:53.392
I twisted my ankle the other day.

37:53.593 --> 37:55.473
My roommate brought me
a large bag of medicine.

37:55.473 --> 37:56.633
She didn't know who sent it.

37:57.112 --> 37:58.992
There were a lot
of arthritis medicines inside.

37:59.432 --> 38:00.473
I was thinking,

38:01.432 --> 38:03.713
besides you and Dad, the only person

38:04.673 --> 38:06.232
who knows about this is Chen Luzhou.

38:08.753 --> 38:10.392
I thought he had gone back to Beijing.

38:11.032 --> 38:12.312
I went looking in the rain.

38:14.713 --> 38:16.192
Zhi, actually...

38:21.473 --> 38:22.992
(Snitch.)

38:26.593 --> 38:27.593
Actually, what?

38:28.272 --> 38:31.272
Actually, I saw a saying online.

38:31.513 --> 38:32.513
No matter

38:33.072 --> 38:34.152
how far apart we are,

38:34.272 --> 38:36.312
we'll meet as we expected.

38:36.432 --> 38:37.633
So, you and Chen Luzhou

38:37.633 --> 38:38.793
will definitely meet again.

38:38.873 --> 38:40.312
I never said I wanted to see him.

38:41.152 --> 38:41.720
By the way,

38:42.032 --> 38:43.673
I'll text you my new number.

38:45.032 --> 38:46.112
You've changed your number?

38:46.833 --> 38:47.834
Didn't you say that you

38:47.834 --> 38:49.432
were worried Luzhou would call you?

38:49.432 --> 38:51.232
That's why
you never changed your number.

38:52.473 --> 38:53.473
Done.

38:55.793 --> 38:56.353
Nowadays,

38:56.353 --> 38:58.112
it's easy to contact someone
if you want to.

38:58.272 --> 38:59.272
What do you mean?

38:59.593 --> 39:01.432
You didn't give Chen Luzhou
your new number?

39:02.473 --> 39:03.473
No.

39:04.232 --> 39:05.232
There's no need, right?

39:06.593 --> 39:07.593
It's okay.

39:17.992 --> 39:19.873
(Tell Chen Luzhou to hurry up.)

39:20.032 --> 39:21.432
(Zhi is ready to move on.)

39:47.713 --> 39:48.713
Zhao Tianqi.

39:48.793 --> 39:49.793
Tianqi, let's go eat.

39:50.673 --> 39:51.673
He's not here.

39:53.032 --> 39:54.032
Hey, you...

39:57.513 --> 39:59.192
Chen Luzhou!

40:00.032 --> 40:00.753
Ke.

40:00.913 --> 40:01.432
You...

40:01.833 --> 40:03.513
What are you doing here?

40:04.432 --> 40:04.992
I live here.

40:05.152 --> 40:06.152
You, I...

40:06.432 --> 40:07.593
- I...
- You also live here?

40:12.992 --> 40:14.112
What's going on?

40:15.112 --> 40:16.753
I didn't expect to see you this soon.

40:17.112 --> 40:18.112
What do you mean?

40:19.553 --> 40:20.033
Nothing.

40:20.033 --> 40:22.112
I participated
in the waitlist admission test.

40:22.513 --> 40:23.513
Public Administration.

40:24.513 --> 40:25.953
Doesn't matter.

40:26.152 --> 40:27.633
With your brain, you'll do great.

40:29.432 --> 40:30.432
Wait a minute.

40:32.593 --> 40:33.873
You.

40:34.633 --> 40:36.673
You came here without telling me?

40:37.312 --> 40:38.352
Unbelievable.

40:39.112 --> 40:40.112
My bad.

40:41.793 --> 40:42.793
Have you eaten?

40:44.352 --> 40:45.432
I need to tidy up first.

40:45.633 --> 40:47.112
Tidy up for what? Let's go.

40:47.312 --> 40:48.432
Soon there'll be nothing.

40:48.432 --> 40:49.432
Let's go.

40:49.633 --> 40:50.633
Hurry up.

40:51.953 --> 40:53.833
(Reporting to Zhi,
here at the training school.)

40:54.633 --> 40:56.673
Okay, we'll meet
during the National Day holiday.

40:58.272 --> 40:59.513
On the way to the No.2 canteen,

40:59.513 --> 41:00.793
many people were sizing him up.

41:00.793 --> 41:01.793
Super handsome.

41:02.232 --> 41:03.152
- Xu Zhi.
- Xu Zhi.

41:03.152 --> 41:03.833
Come quick.

41:03.833 --> 41:04.754
Me and Liu Yisi

41:04.754 --> 41:05.833
saw a handsome guy.

41:05.953 --> 41:06.953
Huh?

41:07.272 --> 41:08.272
How handsome is he?

41:08.432 --> 41:09.793
- Very.
- Extremely handsome.

41:09.793 --> 41:11.432
All the girls outside the canteen

41:11.432 --> 41:12.833
were secretly checking him up.

41:13.072 --> 41:14.392
That Foreign Languages girl

41:14.392 --> 41:15.713
even asked for his number.

41:15.913 --> 41:17.992
I heard he's from Public Administration.

41:18.513 --> 41:19.673
We'll be attending

41:19.673 --> 41:21.152
Professor Wang's class together!

41:21.352 --> 41:22.873
The class will be a big hit.

41:23.312 --> 41:25.072
You two are so infatuated.

41:25.072 --> 41:26.432
Don't forget to study,

41:26.432 --> 41:27.553
or you won't graduate.

41:28.192 --> 41:29.513
Einstein once said

41:29.953 --> 41:31.793
admiring handsome guys is good for you.

41:31.793 --> 41:33.753
That is very good for studying.

41:34.392 --> 41:35.392
Really.

41:35.553 --> 41:36.553
You haven't eaten yet?

41:37.232 --> 41:38.633
Have a meeting later.

41:39.673 --> 41:40.753
Go to No.2 canteen.

41:40.753 --> 41:42.553
He should be eating there.

41:42.553 --> 41:43.593
No.2 canteen is good.

41:43.873 --> 41:45.072
It has pig's trotters rice.

41:45.833 --> 41:47.112
Forget that!

41:47.112 --> 41:48.112
The cute guy's there!

41:48.553 --> 41:49.553
Really.

41:51.032 --> 41:52.312
Such a face is wasted.

41:52.432 --> 41:53.432
So dense.

42:01.713 --> 42:02.714
This is delicious.

42:02.714 --> 42:04.112
There's a line every day.

42:04.312 --> 42:04.593
Okay.

42:04.593 --> 42:05.272
We'll be late.

42:05.272 --> 42:06.272
Xu Zhi.

42:06.808 --> 42:09.673
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

42:09.673 --> 42:10.673
Coming.

42:13.720 --> 42:17.570
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

42:17.570 --> 42:22.188
♪A brilliant scenery♪

42:22.360 --> 42:27.713
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

42:28.952 --> 42:33.752
♪The roar of the heartbeat♪

42:33.752 --> 42:37.753
♪Drew a trajectory♪

42:38.840 --> 42:44.822
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

42:46.456 --> 42:52.018
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

42:53.592 --> 42:56.600
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

42:56.728 --> 43:01.320
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

43:01.784 --> 43:06.296
♪How you long for the future♪

43:06.296 --> 43:09.313
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

43:09.624 --> 43:11.815
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

43:12.408 --> 43:15.576
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

43:17.176 --> 43:21.680
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

43:21.912 --> 43:27.315
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

43:28.408 --> 43:32.277
♪The endless clear sky
disperses the rainy season♪

43:32.408 --> 43:34.870
♪Taking away all the mud♪

43:36.632 --> 43:38.433
♪Leaving an echo♪

43:39.593 --> 43:40.760
Is this good?

43:40.760 --> 43:43.021
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

43:45.336 --> 43:48.352
♪You're the only one♪

43:48.352 --> 43:49.352
Don't recognize me?

43:52.633 --> 43:54.272
What's your relationship with Luzhou?

43:56.753 --> 43:57.753
His older brother.

43:58.192 --> 43:59.192
Chen Sanzhou.

44:00.392 --> 44:01.392
Alright.

44:01.593 --> 44:02.953
Then let's keep our distance.

44:05.432 --> 44:06.913
After all, he's still in Europe.

44:08.112 --> 44:09.112
Xu Zhi.

44:54.904 --> 44:58.405
(What kind of person is he?)

44:59.224 --> 45:04.183
(He's a punk.)

45:08.825 --> 45:14.641
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

45:15.193 --> 45:20.721
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

45:22.233 --> 45:26.681
♪The world is too quiet♪

45:27.673 --> 45:34.601
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

45:35.513 --> 45:40.601
♪Who will visit me♪

45:41.657 --> 45:47.281
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

45:48.025 --> 45:51.081
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

45:51.321 --> 45:56.641
♪Into concern and care♪

46:02.169 --> 46:07.281
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

46:07.801 --> 46:13.641
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

46:15.097 --> 46:18.481
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

46:18.617 --> 46:24.841
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:25.337 --> 46:28.281
♪The lonely clock♪

46:28.441 --> 46:33.041
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

46:33.433 --> 46:36.681
♪Are we both♪

46:36.953 --> 46:40.481
♪Attracted to each other♪

46:41.625 --> 46:48.241
♪Falling into you♪

46:51.961 --> 46:57.761
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:58.617 --> 47:01.281
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

47:01.817 --> 47:06.441
♪From reaching eternity♪

47:06.841 --> 47:10.121
♪After rushing recklessly♪

47:10.329 --> 47:13.761
♪We approach each other♪

47:15.033 --> 47:18.641
♪Without turning back♪

47:20.025 --> 47:27.681
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

47:28.313 --> 47:34.801
♪Falling into you♪
